      "message": "This would also include stuff in additionalResponses, which should not be put in instanceNameToResponse if it wasn\u0027t augmented by the incoming packet (so if it wasn\u0027t in the modified list), as these are locally generated \"known responses\".\n\nYou could check if instanceNameToResponse.containsKey, since you only need to update the last receipt time if it\u0027s an existing response (with a comment explaining the others are the locally-generated additionalResponses)\n\nOr you could check that response.hasPtrRecord(), as I think a locally generated response that wasn\u0027t augmented won\u0027t have a PTR record. But that\u0027s maybe a bit less clear.",
